  "headline": "Prabowo Praises Police Chief Suyudi Amidst Mining Revenue Reform",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo Praises Police Chief Suyudi",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto praised Police Chief Suyudi Ario Seto's work while advancing policies to increase state control over mining sector revenues.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto commended Police Chief Suyudi Ario Seto for significant anti-narcotics efforts and institutional integrity.",
    "The government is actively pursuing a policy to secure 70 percent of national mining revenues to support state development goals.",
    "President Prabowo emphasized that national stability depends on the eradication of corruption within the bureaucracy and security sectors."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto recently held discussions with OECD Secretary-General Mathias Cormann to advance Indonesia's accession to the organization, underscoring his focus on economic development. Concurrently, the administration is prioritizing systemic reforms, including a proposal to increase state revenue shares from mining concessions to 70 percent, a move supported by the Presidential Advisory Council. To manage these resources, the President has urged universities to develop specialized human capital for the mining and plantation sectors. Amid these economic objectives, President Prabowo has stressed the importance of integrity, warning that corruption within the military, police, and government ranks poses an existential threat to the nation. He specifically praised National Police Chief Suyudi Ario Seto following the destruction of over 600 tons of illicit drugs, marking a continued emphasis on law enforcement standards to facilitate a stable environment for national progress.",
